---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Editorial Standards" description="Peptide Rulebook editorial standards for sourcing, review, corrections, and independence." canonical="/about/editorial-standards">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About', href: '/about' }, { label: 'Editorial Standards', href: '/about/editorial-standards' }]} />
    <div class="py-10 prose max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-ink">Editorial standards</h1>
      <h2>Source-linking</h2>
      <p>Every status assertion and claim-check verdict is tied to one or more controlling sources. We link to official pages, PDFs, or archives whenever possible.</p>
      <h2>Review</h2>
      <p>Substance status pages are reviewed by a qualified regulatory reviewer. Rule explainers are reviewed for legal accuracy. Updates are dated and may include author, fact-checker, and legal reviewer credits.</p>
      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>When we find an error, we correct it, note the change, and update the last-verified date. See our <a href="/about/corrections">corrections log</a>.</p>
      <h2>Independence</h2>
      <p>We do not accept payment or incentives to alter a status, ranking, or conclusion. Commercial relationships are disclosed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
